y Images&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;随着总统竞选的开始，玛丽娜·勒庞和她的门生乔丹·巴尔德拉在法国最大政党的高层之间的&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;不愉快的伙伴关系&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/EMKYfh6tQG5Wn0X-VhlooCQvkgipVSpkHlBVdVTRtvLCny2FkRezRS1jf8YtBYQpX5sG-2QSRvWhF5muk-iux8_IHEKn0HzbFBuFYOJxxxbA8BLPMVFn-WOUbG2nvp5KWBzttJuGxSwI2eKQugNsJrYm8nHV6u7v3K4dWQ_pLPy5-mSqG6FK8NtF9WedUUDniYLqeeKcF-LT9ZzZkMdYzM4yT2gxYZz6hycNLPxWnj4e3L8quk-metWux0IL5aHBLhvHzg8EE6M2IsqubMGCgK5wNIv_pYMvh5_alh5Qysj0a4hmxxOupJ5LM4dXEZWWlEOhHSl0aCZp-ChgI5iT3jaU0eSwqvA766CLtrOKlZtq7cL0xiIOQBHAjTuDhBlZPL_eA-FcAcfQPm-d684D9KWcSRNfPI2muG2mH_J95sh8WBAi2Y6z9DdveHIYArkPWeNgXlH2q-1IG0oA1VoKT2NdvgZStppuhzhche6HzgSEI6MxBuAqP9pyBtoobkwX3xKFuZjX6w1mz_fE6C2oGhcrrpqoXHVntmdnkWF7/qmfSsszBI-30GRkIqihiu4M-g8eqcXmF/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="勒庞将门生推到一边，以维护对极右翼的控制"&gt;正在瓦解&lt;/a&gt;。自 7 月法院批准她竞选最高职位以来，勒庞重申了她对已故父亲于 1972 年创立的全国集会党的控制。在她与贪污定罪的后果作斗争时，他们忽视了政策和风格上的分歧，现在正出现在公众视野中。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;距离美国中期选举不到四个星期，关键战场州的&lt;strong style="font-size: 16px;"&gt;共和党参议员候选人&lt;/strong&gt;更加坚决地与特朗普及其一些标志性政策&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/BU4_WM5XzduiApyOyENIzWjblyNf7wEULEYTC_gM_vbWQ8b22LmA2BUyQSiR-NW6iBWZzc6UyZa3JAf-jdthOAjHfE3mtS2NpVfLd3FShnhRIXZ24sO3h2lDeLIP_usXVDArgapNxaZ2dRQJ_ZnvNtW-MbIRin6exHbgvCtpxPtGlaMd7TITWv6ai_aRyxCwfiY4NIWranjc0Hd6XLPtt2nn5AhMwClnR62yA_xsjm5z5AX9qWZqz0RCwckWq8qd1LkDAtaX2t2fmR0i6rf_eMQMJN0FQUW1At_AoXbSINl9msVWQ53KAPhRd4Rw2ibuLi9YocFt8h_Pp2La7-YwZ4ZY9STlhk50o5eEHyvYIVNEe4PRVlrKyu2jclEY4pqnEA200-MSjrGqrblpxcCooTHNq9ok9yC1KkgNaTUR3_8ejDI92S9AMxHiXzl1gksO4blrt71o_meeQfPvmzsiuhm-ogHFE0hN7_APAJr-Tgg_G3UeMA2ttmWKWcY2-t1YU43P0dEJxFD6pfu7pRRPt_0BLinLDyFrxtiNAqpXZvDpug/X27BrFnFJmBhGwWQpko_sI00IUWrcvqh/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="参议院竞选愈演愈烈，四面楚歌的共和党人拒绝了特朗普"&gt;保持距离&lt;/a&g